Package: bloodspottR
Title: Calibrated Histology Burden and Erythrocyte Profile Analysis
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", email = "58561665+r-heller@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for physically calibrated histology burden summaries,
    explicit measurement-area accounting, and tissue-aware spatial analysis.
    Supports reproducible development of red-chromogen and erythrocyte-profile
    workflows. Image-derived candidates require independent validation before
    biological interpretation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: cli, digest, jsonlite
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), sf, spatstat.geom, shiny, processx, ps,
    openxlsx2, cellspecR, knitr, rmarkdown, covr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
URL: https://github.com/CTTIR/bloodspottR
BugReports: https://github.com/CTTIR/bloodspottR/issues
